meta {
  name: List ASH Students for Profile dropdown
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lookup/ash-students-profile
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List ASH Students for Profile Dropdown

  Returns a lightweight list of accepted ASH students for use in student profile dropdown/select components. Queries `ash_student` with a left join on `ash_exit`, filtered to only accepted students. Each entry contains the student `id`, `name` (first name + surname), and `status`.

  ## Authorization
  No authentication required. This is a public lookup endpoint.

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns an array of `{ id, name, status }` objects for accepted ASH students.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "students found successfully",
    "data": [
      { "id": "uuid", "name": "John Doe", "status": "accepted" }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```

  | Field    | Type     | Description                                              |
  |----------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------|
  | `id`     | `string` | The ASH student record UUID.                             |
  | `name`   | `string` | Full name (first name + surname) from ash_student.       |
  | `status` | `string` | Student status (always "accepted" for this endpoint).    |

  ## Caching
  Response is cached under `cedarrise:lookup:ashstudents` with `LISTS` TTL (10 mins).

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description              |
  |-----------------------------|--------------------------|
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
